{"id": "37092", "title": "小妻宝贝", "author": "香奈儿", "category": "文学名著", "count": 23, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37092.htm", "intro": "所谓“受人之托，忠人之事”，她是很懂这个道理，\r\n但当她遵照嘱咐，要去照顾忘年之交步爷爷的“小孙子”时，\r\n才发现事情大条！那个据说孤苦零丁、一无所有的可怜孙子，\r\n根本是个大男人，而且还是个喊水会结冻的集团大总裁！\r\n天哪，她是要怎样照顾一个又冷又酷，又有钱得要命的男人？\r\n\r\n这疯女人是哪来的？！一直嚷著要照顾他，不然对不起爷爷，\r\n拜托！他比她大四岁、比她有钱、比她有脑子，是谁照顾谁？\r\n而且多跟她相处一分钟，他的理性跟脑细胞都被她杀光光，\r\n如果哪天他真的想被她照顾，一定是世界末日、宇宙毁灭──\r\n没想到末日近在眼前，他看她越来越顺眼，有意思……", "base": "files/article/html/37/37092", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2909953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(1)", "file": "2909954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(2)", "file": "2909955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(1)", "file": "2909956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(2)", "file": "2909957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(1)", "file": "2909958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(2)", "file": "2909959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(1)", "file": "2909960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(2)", "file": "2909961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(1)", "file": "2909962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(2)", "file": "2909963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章(1)", "file": "2909964.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(2)", "file": "2909965.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(1)", "file": "2909966.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(2)", "file": "2909967.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(1)", "file": "2909968.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(2)", "file": "2909969.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(1)", "file": "2909970.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(2)", "file": "2909971.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(1)", "file": "2909972.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(2)", "file": "2909973.html", "available": true}, {"title": "尾声", "file": "2909974.html", "available": true}, {"title": "后记", "file": "2909975.html", "availa